- Type: {{ entity.entity_type }}{{ ", listed" if entity.listed else ", not listed" }}
- Industry (ANZSIC): {{ entity.industry_anzsic }}
- Financial year end: {{ entity.financial_year_end or "not recorded" }}; accounting system: {{ entity.accounting_system or "not recorded" }}
{% if entity.notes %}
- Notes: {{ entity.notes }}
{% endif %}

Periods:
- Current period: {{ period_current.start }} to {{ period_current.end }} ({{ period_current.months }} month{{ "" if period_current.months == 1 else "s" }}, {{ period_current.days }} days).
{% if period_prior.known %}
- Prior period: {{ period_prior.start }} to {{ period_prior.end }} ({{ period_prior.months }} month{{ "" if period_prior.months == 1 else "s" }}, {{ period_prior.days }} days).
{% else %}
- The prior period start is not declared; treat the prior period as the same length as the current period.
{% endif %}
- Profit or loss accounts are compared with the prior period only when the two periods are of equal length, in the existing rule A01.

Materiality benchmark amounts (cents; revenue and expenses are positive):
