| {{ b.basis }} | {{ amounts_current[b.basis] }} | {{ amounts_prior[b.basis] }} |
{% endfor %}

Benchmark list and percentage ranges (choose one row, then a percentage within it):
{% for b in benchmarks %}
- `{{ b.basis }}`: {{ b.pct_min }} to {{ b.pct_max }}{% if b.example_pct is not none %}, ASA 320 A8 example {{ b.example_pct }}{% endif %}. {{ b.source }}{{ " The range is by convention." if b.convention else "" }}
{% endfor %}

